<title>PHILIPPINES: Fil-Estate sets 100 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Fil-Estate sets 100 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property developer Fil-Estate Land Inc said on Thursday its board of directors had approved a 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>In a press statement, the company said the dividend would amount to 1.012 billion shares and would be taken out of the additional paid-in capital of the company.</p>
<p>No other details were given.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418939 fax 8176267</p>
